---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Install bob';
const subtitle = 'Watch the choreography land. Install, invoke, one step, stop.';
---
<Base title={title} description={subtitle}>
  <article class="etude-page">
    <header class="etude-head">
      <p class="etude-kicker">Etude · The anti-cascader</p>
      <h1 class="etude-title">{title}</h1>
      <p class="etude-relief">{subtitle}</p>
      <nav class="etude-nav">
        <a href="/etudes/anti-cascader/">← anti-cascader etudes</a>
        <span class="etude-nav-sep">·</span>
        <a href="/puzzles/bob-the-fixer-as-anti-cascader/">essay</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="etude-intro">
      <p>The team installs bob, invokes a migration, watches one step land, and gets a draft PR. No fan-out. No platform-team push. The next step waits for the team's clock.</p>
      <p>Press play. Watch the shape.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="etude-stage">
      <div class="etude-card">
        <p class="etude-step">Team's terminal · Spring Boot 2.7 repo</p>

        <div class="term" id="term">
          <div class="term-chrome">
            <span class="term-dot term-dot-r"></span>
            <span class="term-dot term-dot-y"></span>
            <span class="term-dot term-dot-g"></span>
            <span class="term-title">~/svc/orders-api · main</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-body" id="term-body" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="controls">
          <button type="button" id="play" class="etude-next">Play</button>
          <button type="button" id="reset" class="etude-ghost" disabled>Reset</button>
          <label class="speed">
            <span class="speed-label">Speed</span>
            <select id="speed">
              <option value="1">1x</option>
              <option value="2" selected>2x</option>
              <option value="4">4x</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div id="banner" class="banner" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="etude-failure">
      <h2 class="etude-failure-title">What happened</h2>
      <p>The team typed two commands. Bob explained the step <em>before</em> running it, then ran it, then opened a draft PR. <strong>Step 02 of 7 lands as a 14-line PR.</strong> Steps 03 through 07 wait until the team invokes again — that day, that week, that quarter.</p>
      <p>The platform team that authored the migration never opened the PR. They wrote the codemod and the explanation and shipped it as a skill. The team pulled.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="etude-coda">
      <p>Single-shot would have been one 700-line PR. Choreographed is seven 14-line PRs. The team reads each one.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  // A scripted terminal transcript. Each frame is either a typed line, a printed
  // line, or a multi-line block. The animation paces through the choreography
  // — install, invoke, explain, run, diff, PR, stop — at the user's chosen speed.

  const FRAMES = [
    { kind: 'prompt', text: '~ %' },
    { kind: 'type', text: 'claude' },
    { kind: 'enter' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: 'Claude Code · session started' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'cc-prompt' },
    { kind: 'type', text: '/plugin marketplace add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/parrik/bob-the-fixer/main/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json' },
    { kind: 'enter' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: 'added marketplace: bob-the-fixer' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'cc-prompt' },
    { kind: 'type', text: '/plugin install bob-the-fixer' },
    { kind: 'enter' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: 'installed: bob-the-fixer (4 skills)' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  /migrate-spring-boot-3' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  /migrate-junit-4-to-5' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  /migrate-jest-to-vitest' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  /adopt-structured-logging' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'cc-prompt' },
    { kind: 'type', text: '/migrate-spring-boot-3' },
    { kind: 'enter' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ reading .migration-state.json (none — creating)' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ step 01 of 7 · precheck' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  · on Spring Boot 2.7+ ✓' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  · tests green on main ✓' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  · working tree clean ✓' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  · CI pipeline detected ✓' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: 'step 01 passed. proceeding to step 02.' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'block', cls: 'term-explain', lines: [
      '┌─ step 02 · rename javax.* → jakarta.* ─────────────────',
      '│',
      '│ Why: Spring Boot 3 moved to the Jakarta EE namespace.',
      '│ This is mechanical and byte-deterministic. Touches',
      '│ imports + fully-qualified references.',
      '│',
      '│ Common subset:',
      '│   javax.persistence.*  → jakarta.persistence.*',
      '│   javax.servlet.*      → jakarta.servlet.*',
      '│   javax.validation.*   → jakarta.validation.*',
      '│',
      '│ Risk: low. AST pattern is unambiguous.',
      '│ What to look for in review: a few hundred mechanical',
      '│ rewrites. Skim a handful, merge.',
      '└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────',
    ]},
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ running steps/02-jakarta-imports/transform.ts' },
    { kind: 'progress', total: 4 },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ 2 files changed · +10 −10' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'block', cls: 'term-diff', lines: [
      'src/main/java/com/example/orders/Order.java',
      '-import javax.persistence.Entity;',
      '-import javax.persistence.Id;',
      '+import jakarta.persistence.Entity;',
      '+import jakarta.persistence.Id;',
      '',
      ' @Entity',
      ' public class Order {',
      '     @Id private Long id;',
    ]},
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ running checkpoint: ./mvnw compile && ./mvnw test' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '  BUILD SUCCESS · tests pass' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ creating branch: chore/sb3-step-02-jakarta-imports' },
    { kind: 'echo', text: '→ opening draft PR · "step 02 — javax→jakarta imports"' },
    { kind: 'gap' },

    { kind: 'block', cls: 'term-stop', lines: [
      '┌─ stop ─────────────────────────────────────────────────',
      '│ step 02 of 7 done. PR is yours to review and merge.',
      '│',
      '│ when you are ready: invoke /migrate-spring-boot-3 again.',
      '│ I will read .migration-state.json and pick up at step 03.',
      '└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────',
    ]},
  ];

  const term = document.getElementById('term-body');
  const playBtn = document.getElementById('play');
  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');
  const speedSel = document.getElementById('speed');
  const banner = document.getElementById('banner');

  let running = false;
  let cancelled = false;

  function speedMul() { return parseFloat(speedSel.value || '2'); }
  function pace(ms) { return ms / speedMul(); }

  function append(html) {
    const d = document.createElement('div');
    d.innerHTML = html;
    term.appendChild(d);
    term.scrollTop = term.scrollHeight;
    return d;
  }

  function appendText(text, cls = '') {
    return append(`<span class="${cls}">${escapeHtml(text)}</span>`);
  }

  function escapeHtml(s) {
    return String(s).replace(/[&<>]/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;'}[c]));
  }

  function sleep(ms) {
    return new Promise(res => {
      const id = setTimeout(() => res(), pace(ms));
      sleep._cancel = () => { clearTimeout(id); res(); };
    });
  }

  async function typeLine(text, prefix = '') {
    const row = append(`<div class="term-line"><span class="term-prefix">${prefix}</span><span class="term-typed"></span><span class="caret">▍</span></div>`);
    const target = row.querySelector('.term-typed');
    for (const ch of text) {
      if (cancelled) return;
      target.textContent += ch;
      await sleep(28);
    }
    row.querySelector('.caret')?.remove();
    await sleep(120);
  }

  async function progressBar(total) {
    const row = append(`<div class="term-progress"><span class="bar"><span class="fill" style="width:0%"></span></span><span class="pct">0/${total}</span></div>`);
    const fill = row.querySelector('.fill');
    const pct = row.querySelector('.pct');
    for (let i = 1; i <= total; i++) {
      if (cancelled) return;
      const w = Math.round((i / total) * 100);
      fill.style.width = w + '%';
      pct.textContent = `${i}/${total}`;
      await sleep(110);
    }
  }

  async function renderFrame(f) {
    if (cancelled) return;
    switch (f.kind) {
      case 'prompt':
        append(`<div class="term-line term-shellprompt"><span class="term-prefix">${escapeHtml(f.text)} </span></div>`);
        break;
      case 'cc-prompt':
        append(`<div class="term-line term-ccprompt"><span class="term-prefix">&gt; </span></div>`);
        break;
      case 'type': {
        const last = term.querySelector('.term-line:last-child');
        if (last) {
          const typed = document.createElement('span');
          typed.className = 'term-typed';
          last.appendChild(typed);
          const caret = document.createElement('span');
          caret.className = 'caret';
          caret.textContent = '▍';
          last.appendChild(caret);
          for (const ch of f.text) {
            if (cancelled) return;
            typed.textContent += ch;
            await sleep(26);
          }
          last.querySelector('.caret')?.remove();
        }
        break;
      }
      case 'enter':
        await sleep(220);
        break;
      case 'echo':
        appendText(f.text, 'term-echo');
        await sleep(140);
        break;
      case 'block': {
        const wrap = append(`<div class="${f.cls}"></div>`);
        for (const ln of f.lines) {
          if (cancelled) return;
          const line = document.createElement('div');
          line.className = 'term-block-line';
          line.textContent = ln;
          wrap.appendChild(line);
          await sleep(70);
        }
        await sleep(180);
        break;
      }
      case 'progress':
        await progressBar(f.total);
        await sleep(140);
        break;
      case 'gap':
        append(`<div class="term-gap"></div>`);
        await sleep(180);
        break;
    }
  }

  async function play() {
    if (running) return;
    running = true; cancelled = false;
    playBtn.disabled = true; resetBtn.disabled = true;
    banner.className = 'banner';
    banner.innerHTML = '';
    term.innerHTML = '';

    for (const f of FRAMES) {
      if (cancelled) break;
      await renderFrame(f);
    }

    if (!cancelled) {
      banner.className = 'banner banner-shown';
      banner.innerHTML = '<strong>Step 02 of 7 landed.</strong> The team has a 14-line draft PR. The next six steps wait. <em>Team-paced. No platform-team push.</em>';
    }

    running = false;
    playBtn.disabled = false;
    resetBtn.disabled = false;
  }

  function reset() {
    cancelled = true;
    if (sleep._cancel) sleep._cancel();
    term.innerHTML = '';
    banner.className = 'banner';
    banner.innerHTML = '';
    running = false;
    playBtn.disabled = false;
    resetBtn.disabled = true;
  }

  playBtn.addEventListener('click', play);
  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', reset);
</script>

<style is:global>
  .etude-page { max-width: 38rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; }
  .etude-head { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .etude-kicker {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--label-size);
    letter-spacing: var(--label-tracking);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .etude-title { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .etude-relief { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .etude-nav { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .etude-nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .etude-nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .etude-nav-sep { margin: 0 0.5rem; opacity: 0.5; }

  .etude-intro { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .etude-intro p { margin: 0 0 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .etude-stage { min-height: 22rem; }
  .etude-card {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .etude-step {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--label-size);
    letter-spacing: var(--label-tracking);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  /* === terminal === */
  .term {
    background: #1c1814;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .term-chrome {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
    background: #2a241e;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #3a322a;
  }
  .term-dot { width: 0.65rem; height: 0.65rem; border-radius: 50%; }
  .term-dot-r { background: #d96a5a; }
  .term-dot-y { background: #d6a52b; }
  .term-dot-g { background: #5aa86a; }
  .term-title {
    margin-left: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #b8a99a;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .term-body {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    height: 26rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    color: #e8dcc8;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }
  .term-body::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
  .term-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #3a322a; border-radius: 3px; }
  .term-line { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
  .term-prefix { color: #b8a99a; }
  .term-shellprompt .term-prefix { color: #6fa8a4; }
  .term-ccprompt .term-prefix { color: #d6a52b; }
  .term-typed { color: #f4ead6; }
  .caret {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #f4ead6;
    animation: termblink 1s steps(2) infinite;
    margin-left: 0;
  }
  @keyframes termblink { 0%,49%{opacity:1} 50%,100%{opacity:0} }
  .term-echo { display: block; color: #b8a99a; }
  .term-gap { height: 0.45rem; }

  .term-explain, .term-stop {
    color: #c9b890;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    border-left: 2px solid #6fa8a4;
    padding-left: 0.45rem;
  }
  .term-stop { border-left-color: #d6a52b; }
  .term-block-line { white-space: pre; }

  .term-diff {
    color: #c9b890;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    background: #16120e;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .term-diff .term-block-line { white-space: pre; }
  .term-diff .term-block-line:nth-child(2),
  .term-diff .term-block-line:nth-child(3) { color: #d96a5a; }
  .term-diff .term-block-line:nth-child(4),
  .term-diff .term-block-line:nth-child(5) { color: #7fb98a; }

  .term-progress {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    color: #b8a99a;
  }
  .bar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14rem;
    max-width: 60%;
    height: 0.55rem;
    background: #3a322a;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background: #6fa8a4;
    transition: width 100ms linear;
  }
  .pct { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #b8a99a; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* === controls === */
  .controls { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .etude-next {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.2rem; min-height: 44px;
    border: none; background: var(--text); color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 180ms ease, transform 120ms ease, opacity 180ms ease;
  }
  .etude-next:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--accent); }
  .etude-next:active:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .etude-next:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .etude-next:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .etude-ghost {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.2rem; min-height: 44px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease;
  }
  .etude-ghost:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .etude-ghost:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .speed {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted);
  }
  .speed-label {
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .speed select {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.32rem 1.6rem 0.32rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--bg) url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 10 6'><path fill='%23888' d='M5 6L0 0h10z'/></svg>") no-repeat right 0.45rem center/8px 5px;
    color: var(--text); cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* === banner === */
  .banner {
    margin: 0; min-height: 0;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px);
    transition: opacity 380ms ease, transform 380ms ease;
  }
  .banner-shown {
    opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: rgba(138, 52, 32, 0.06);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .banner em { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; }

  /* === failure / coda === */
  .etude-failure { margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .etude-failure-title {
    font-family: var(--serif-display); font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: var(--text);
  }
  .etude-failure p { margin: 0 0 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); }

  .etude-coda { margin: 2rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .etude-coda p { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

  /* === mobile === */
  @media (max-width: 32rem) {
    .etude-title { font-size: 1.85rem; }
    .etude-card { padding: 1.15rem 1.1rem 1rem; border-radius: 10px; }
    .term-body { height: 22rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.74rem; }
    .speed { margin-left: 0; }
    .controls { gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
